# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Build context for the OnTrak Tix image.
#
# Two rules: never copy in what the image installs or generates itself, and
# never let local state or a secret reach a layer. Nothing excluded here is
# needed by `npm run build`.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Dependencies and build output — reinstalled and regenerated inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets. Compose injects these at run time; a layer would freeze them forever.
.env
.env*.local
*.pem

# Local state: attachment blobs, incident evidence under object lock, and the
# evidence directory the packet verifier writes to. A deployment's records must
# not be baked into an image.
.ontrak-tix-blobs
.ontrak-tix-evidence

# Repository tooling and the image definition itself
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
test-results
playwright-report
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
